{"ticker":"CMPDI","symbol":"CMPDI","instrumentId":3201302,"name":"Central Mine Plan.","industry":"NSE-Energy-Coal","about":"\"Central Mine Planning & Design Institute Limited offers consultancy and technical services for coal, lignite, and other mineral projects. Its key services include geological exploration, mine planning and design, environmental management, and survey and mapping services.\n\nThe company supports both open-cast and underground mining operations. It operates through seven regional institutes, along with exploration camps and laboratories across key mining regions in India.\n\nIt serves government agencies, public sector undertakings, and private companies. The company also undertakes international assignments, providing feasibility studies, resource evaluation, and end-to-end mining consultancy services.\"","website":"www.cmpdi.co.in","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:12:09.740Z","basis":"standalone","price":{"value":181.18,"changePct":-2.82649503888441,"week52High":277.5,"week52Low":151.47},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹12,936 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹2,430 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"107,100,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"53"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"65,091,498"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"1.74%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"5.67"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.7"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.04"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.06"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-78%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"19.25"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"27–30"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"26.9%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"10.03"},{"label":"Volume","value":"677,256"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,195,101"},{"label":"Master score","value":"42"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"58"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"49"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"151"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating